<title>PHILIPPINES: Urbancorp Realty to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Urbancorp Realty to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Urbancorp Realty Developers Inc said on Tuesday its board had approved a proposal for the company to buy back its own shares from the market.</p>
<p>In a statement to the Philippine Stock Exchange, it said its management would draw up a scheme for implementation.</p>
<p>Analysts said this is intended to give support to its share price since URDI had fallen below its offer price of 2.33 pesos. It was listed in March last year at the Philippine Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>It closed at 1.64 pesos on Monday.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom 63 2 841-8937 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
